  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal multiprofile models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_031) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.6776). This experiment tests whether replacing resnet50 with the more advanced imagenet_vit_l image encoder (while keeping other parameters fixed) could further improve performance. It isolates the impact of the image encoder's architecture, a critical design choice, and leverages the strong evidence from config_031 to explore a logical extension."
